Wizard mode testing indicates that the slime won't attack Rodney at
its starting level.  It will attack angels, but this has a bit of a
drawback when the angels attack back. Maybe it'd be plausible once
the slime gains a few levels, but I don't know of any quick way of
doing that in wizard mode since it won't drink potions.  Or maybe
speed monster and invisibility would help some; I didn't try those.
But in either case, the exponential growth could only happen once
the priests start summoning insects, and those are the monsters I
like to keep around as shields.  A single high level slime might
still be of use against the Riders if you can manage it somehow.


